rkflow?</h3><p>Quickler is £20 per active user a month, where an active user is someone who completed at least two workflows that month, with a £20 minimum, dormant users free. There is a free tier of 20 reports a month and up to 10 photos per report, no card and no trial clock, so you can run this self-evaluation without paying anything. Quickler is an audit and evidence tool, not a children's records or child protection system.</p><h3>Related guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/nursery-self-evaluation-scotland.html\">Nursery self-evaluation Scotland guide</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/care-inspectorate-self-evaluation-template-scotland.html\">Care Inspectorate self-evaluation template</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/childminder-self-evaluation-scotland.html\">Childminder self-evaluation Scotland</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/care-inspectorate-grades-explained-scotland.html\">Care Inspectorate grades explained</a></li></ul>"
